comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.908Z",codex-root,Eleven open Dependabot PRs will be evaluated against and superseded by the consolidated tested head.
  "2026-07-16T17:25:27.554Z",codex-root,"Published commit 3401010 on branch chore/repository-security-dependency-recovery and opened consolidated PR https://github.com/unbraind/searxng-cli/pull/31."
  "2026-07-16T17:29:32.077Z",codex-root,All required hosted checks passed on 095aa85. CodeRabbit and Sourcery had no actionable review because the PM initialization exceeded their plan size limits; there are no inline review comments.
  "2026-07-16T17:29:32.077Z",codex-root,"Closed Dependabot PRs 1,2,3,14,18,19,26,28,29,30 as superseded by PR 31; closed PR 27 with explicit minimum-Node type-alignment rationale."
  "2026-07-16T17:32:01.663Z",codex-root,"PR 31 merged at 2026-07-16T17:31:12Z as f859ca0027c527eacfb2c36528f32b2b54817773. Default branch immediately reports zero open Dependabot alerts and zero open CodeQL alerts."
  "2026-07-16T17:32:01.663Z",codex-root,"Repository controls verified after merge: SHA pin enforcement enabled, secret scanning enabled, push protection enabled; local master equals origin/master at f859ca0."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.908Z",codex-root,Do not close bot PRs until the consolidated branch is pushed and demonstrably contains their upgrades.
  "2026-07-16T17:25:27.554Z",codex-root,Current-head hosted proof must be taken after committing this delivery evidence update.
learnings[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.908Z",codex-root,Branch protection requires stable quality-bun quality-node package-smoke gitleaks and CodeQL analyze checks.
  "2026-07-16T17:29:32.077Z",codex-root,Enabling SHA enforcement before a pull_request_target workflow is pinned on the default branch blocks that base workflow; enforcement is temporarily disabled and will be restored immediately after merge.
  "2026-07-16T17:32:01.663Z",codex-root,Tracker closeout belongs in a small post-merge PR so the durable PM state records the real merge SHA without falsifying pre-merge evidence.
